<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech PX50 index ends down on Komercni fall.</title>
<headline>Czech PX50 index ends down on Komercni fall.</headline>
<text>
<p>1420 GMT - Prague Stock Exchange's PX50 index edges down 0.5 points, or 0.10 percent, to 504.5 points, on falls in Komercni Banka.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka down 55 crowns to 1,640</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom up 10 crowns at 3,625</p>
<p>* CEZ up four to 910 crowns</p>
<p>* Gainers outpace losers by 104 to 81, with 52 issues unchanged</p>
<p>* PSE turnover 632 million crowns on volume of 464,298 shares</p>
</text>
